Personal data must be collected in a fair way. and used lawfully.
Personal data must not be used except specified and lawful purpose.
Personal data must be collected only as much as needed. 
Personal data must be accurate.
Personal data must not be kept longer than necessary.
Personal data must be secured properly.
Personal data must not be transfered to another country. unless they provide the same data rights.
Individual's rights must be respected in keeping their data.
